      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Le Corset"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "With its smooth, hand-painted style, Iron Boy is a warm, moving animation about an 11-year-old boy who is forced to rethink his outlook on the world when he receives a life-changing diagnosis."
